From: liken <https://liken.sh>
Subject: [PATCH] meson: build libkmod as default_library asks

shared_library() builds a shared object whatever default_library
names, so a toolchain that links static only cannot build libkmod.
library() builds the kind that default_library names and keeps the
shared build the default. The version script and the soname version
apply to the shared kind only.

Upstream: not submitted

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -421,7 +421,7 @@

 install_headers('libkmod/libkmod.h')

-libkmod = shared_library(
+libkmod = library(
   'kmod',
   libkmod_files,
   dependencies : libkmod_deps + cdeps,
